        <mxCell id="sm-v34" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Rank only moves forward. Lower / stale → history.applied = false.&lt;br&gt;• Terminal: COMPLETED, CANCELLED, REJECTED, FAILED.&lt;br&gt;• Grab cancel is final → CANCELLED (+ status_reason if food already left).&lt;br&gt;• Delivery events apply only if current ≥ READY.&lt;br&gt;• orders.status = rollup(subs) then delivery, one PG transaction.&lt;br&gt;• Reconcile every 5 min. No parked_events table." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="170" width="700" x="40" y="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sm-v35" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3949ab;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;status_mappings (examples)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;font face=&#39;Courier New&#39; style=&#39;font-size:11px&#39;&gt;GRAB&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;COLLECTED&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ OUT_FOR_DELIVERY&lt;br&gt;GRAB&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;DELIVERED&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ DELIVERED&lt;br&gt;GRAB&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;CANCELLED&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ CANCELLED&lt;br&gt;GRAB&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;FAILED&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ FAILED&lt;br&gt;BSL&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;TBD_ACCEPTED → CONFIRMED&lt;br&gt;BSL&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;TBD_COOKING&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ PREPARING&lt;br&gt;BSL&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;TBD_READY&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ READY&lt;br&gt;SDM&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UpdateOrder:OK → CONFIRMED&lt;br&gt;LINEMAN&amp;nbsp;TBD_*&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ (placeholder)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="380" x="780" y="480" as="geometry" />
